    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. go.py:4464-4486: the typed-local call arm reaches _go_method_of_type only under `elif qualified_name in global_symbols`, so _go_promoted_method (go.py:3759) never runs in the promotion case. The method value g := f.Qux resolves (go.py:3710 calls it unconditionally). The existing test passes only because outer and embedded types share a name (test_go_name_scope_by_position.py:485-544). v05."  # b8cc
